}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/killerdevildog/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/killerdevildog/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/killerdevildog/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/killerdevildog/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/killerdevildog/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T01:52:01Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T08:52:23Z","body":"> Ironically, the level of communication is less clear as it's overly verbose and often detracts from the real message, but I'll take your point about being off topic, and mods can flag my messages as such.\r\n\r\nit's possible, and I recommend that you should use AI, and ask it \"Explain like I am 21\" or \"Give me a break down of what this means line by line\" This is how I use AI to help me understand and respond. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3906055477/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"off-topic"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3906070185","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116333#issuecomment-3906070185","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116333","id":3906070185,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7o0eap","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}",